                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "bottom line; i highly recommend this game if you like surreal games with an off-brand humour, a forgiving playstyle, and vaguely uncomfortable music. and if you think you dont like those things, i still think you should play this game.\nfor the less succinct part of the review, i want to say that i bought this game when i was much younger, played it not even one time, soft-locked myself, and gave up. but it stayed with me and i thought about it often. decided to pick it back up recently and its been amazing, as it was when i didnt give it a chance the first time. this game has been with me through a lot of weird stuff, so much so that sometimes i feel like my life plays a tune too similar. i appreciate that hylics makes you slow down a bit, even when youre fighting for your life. \nanyways, ill wrap it up by saying this: remember, you can always crash on the couch.",
